  "user_request_original": "Design a 24-layer planar dielectric stack on a Fused Silica substrate with Air incidence using HfO2 and SiO2. Optimize layer thicknesses using differential evolution with the following constraints: 1) Each layer thickness must be initialized and bounded between 50nm and 280nm (hard cap). 2) Increase mutation step-sizes specifically for thickness values in the 100-150nm regime to enhance sampling density there. 3) Target objective: Maximize mean transmittance in 1530-1565nm band and mean reflectance in 400-700nm band simultaneously. 4) Evaluate performance using coherent TMM at normal incidence. 5) Report best_target_score, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all valid candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count <= 30.",
